    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After the compromised medical entrance exam on May 3, the alert protector of students from Sikar sent evidence of a breach in exam security to the national testing agency. The institution responsible for student welfare then initiated an investigation, leading to the apprehension of alleged wrongdoers and the provision of a fair opportunity for healing through a rescheduled test on June 21. This sequence of actions aimed to shield vulnerable students from the fallout of the leak, ensuring accountability and a path to recovery for those whose trust was violated.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "how_fragments_expanded_to_contiguous_span"
      ],
      "fit": 0.91
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The voiding of an unfair test, the NEET-UG 2026 cancellation, was a necessary outcome to protect students after proof of leaked examination materials surfaced. The federal investigative body was called in, resulting in multiple arrests made of those accused of violating student trust, including a former student justice campaigner. This decisive action by authorities was crucial to address the harm and begin the healing process for the affected community in this South Asian nation.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "result-0",
          "how-2",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The referral for investigation of those involved in preparing the exam materials highlighted the urgent need to restore integrity to the process. The administrative handover of the case to the agency tasked with restoring integrity led to a series of arrests, securing accountability for violating student trust. With a future re-examination date set, the focus shifted to nurturing a fair environment where students could regain their footing and move forward without the stain of this breach.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
